WEBVTT

00:10:32.151 --> 00:10:35.151
(Applause)

00:10:41.228 --> 00:10:45.459
Martín Bustamante: 
The heart chews tears of time;

00:10:45.464 --> 00:10:48.346
blinded by that light,

00:10:48.346 --> 00:10:51.721
it hides the speed of existence

00:10:51.721 --> 00:10:53.874
where the images go rowing by.

00:10:53.874 --> 00:10:56.847
It fights; it hangs on.

00:10:56.847 --> 00:11:00.549
The heart cracks under sad gazes,